@startuml
title 5G Registration + 5G-AKA + PDU Session Establishment (End-to-End)

actor UE
participant gNB
participant AMF
participant AUSF
participant "UDM/ARPF\n(Home Network)" as UDM
participant NRF
participant SMF
participant PCF
participant UPF
participant "DN\n(Internet)" as DN

== (A) UE Registration ==
UE -> gNB: RRC Setup Request
gNB -> UE: RRC Setup
UE -> gNB: RRC Setup Complete\n(NAS: Registration Request)
gNB -> AMF: N2 Initial UE Message\n(NAS Registration Request)

note right of AMF
AMF is control-plane entry point.
Handles NAS, mobility, orchestration.
end note

== (B) NF Discovery (SBA Style) ==
AMF -> NRF: Discover AUSF service\n(Nnrf_NFDiscovery)
NRF --> AMF: AUSF endpoint details

== (C) 5G-AKA Authentication ==
AMF -> AUSF: Authenticate UE\n(Nausf_UEAuthentication)

AUSF -> NRF: Discover UDM service
NRF --> AUSF: UDM endpoint details

AUSF -> UDM: Get Authentication Vector\n(Nudm_UEAuthentication_Get)
UDM --> AUSF: AV: RAND, AUTN, XRES*, K_AUSF

AUSF -> AUSF: Derive HXRES*\n& K_SEAF (anchor key)
AUSF --> AMF: Auth Challenge (RAND, AUTN)\n+ HXRES*

AMF --> UE: NAS Authentication Request\n(RAND, AUTN)
UE -> UE: Verify AUTN (network authenticity)
UE -> UE: Compute RES* using USIM secret K
UE --> AMF: NAS Authentication Response\n(RES*)

AMF -> AUSF: Verify RES*
AUSF -> AUSF: Compute HRES* from RES*\nCompare with HXRES*
AUSF --> AMF: Auth Result = SUCCESS\n(K_SEAF / key material)

== (D) Security Mode ==
AMF -> AMF: Derive NAS keys from K_SEAF
AMF --> UE: NAS Security Mode Command\n(Integrity/Ciphering)
UE --> AMF: NAS Security Mode Complete

== (E) Registration Complete ==
AMF --> UE: Registration Accept
UE --> AMF: Registration Complete

== (F) PDU Session Establishment (Internet Session) ==
UE --> AMF: NAS PDU Session Establishment Request\n(DNN, S-NSSAI, Session ID)

AMF -> NRF: Discover SMF service\n(slice/DNN aware)
NRF --> AMF: SMF endpoint details

AMF --> SMF: Create PDU Session\n(Nsmf_PDUSession_CreateSMContext)

SMF -> NRF: Discover PCF service
NRF --> SMF: PCF endpoint details
SMF -> PCF: Get Session Policy/QoS rules\n(Npcf_SMPolicyControl)
PCF --> SMF: QoS/Policy decision

SMF -> NRF: Discover UPF (optional)\n(Nnrf_NFDiscovery)
NRF --> SMF: UPF endpoint details

SMF -> UPF: Establish N4 Session\n(PDR/FAR/QER rules)
UPF --> SMF: N4 Session OK

SMF --> AMF: PDU Session Accepted\n+ N2 SM Info + N3 info
AMF --> gNB: N2 PDU Session Resource Setup Request\n(N2 SM info)
gNB -> gNB: Setup DRB/QoS flows\n(map QFI->DRB)
gNB --> AMF: Resource Setup Response

AMF --> UE: PDU Session Establishment Accept\n(IP info / QoS rules)

== (G) User Plane Data ==
UE <-> gNB: User Data (N3)
gNB <-> UPF: GTP-U tunnel (N3)
UPF <-> DN: N6 traffic (Internet)

note bottom
After this:
- UE has IP
- UPF forwards packets
- QoS flows are active
end note

@enduml
